forth-hex-viewer
================

Hex viewer that dumps the contents of a file as hex and ASCII.

* 16 bytes per line
* shows the offset of each line
* non-printable bytes shown as '.'

Usage
-----

	gforth src/view.fs <file>

Example output:

	00000000: 69 6E 63 6C 75 64 65 20 62 61 73 65 2E 66 73 0A  include base.fs.

